WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.560
Production never stands still.

00:00:02.560 --> 00:00:05.120
A deadline moves. One order affects the plan.

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:07.680
Every step, connected.

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:10.240
Meet SOMA. Production planning for precision manufacturing.

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:15.360
Move an operation. See the downstream steps follow.

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:17.920
Review the ripple before applying the change.

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:20.480
You keep control.

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:23.040
Keep your process knowledge. Define the route once.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:25.600
Next order. A head start.

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:28.160
SOMA Scheduler.

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:32.000
Your production. A clear plan. Book a demo.
